          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dowiedzmy się, jak pisać instrukcje warunkowe obsługujące określone warunki, takie jak interfejs użytkownika aplikacji poniżej.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    let time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    let image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    let greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podczas przesuwania suwaka ta strona używa instrukcji warunkowych, aby wyświetlać różne powitania, gdy godzina jest mniejsza niż 7, 12, 17 i 21.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    let time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    let image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    let greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Za pomocą instrukcji if i else możemy napisać program, który wyświetla jedno powitanie, jeśli <code>hour &lt; 12</code> ma wartość <code>true</code>, a inne, jeśli ma wartość <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hour</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W przypadku bardziej szczegółowego warunku, na przykład gdy <code>hour</code> nie jest mniejsze niż <code>12</code>, ale jest mniejsze niż <code>17</code>, możemy zamiast tego zapisać <code>else if hour &lt; 17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &gt; 23\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>if</code> i na końcu <code>hour &lt; 17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else if",
            "id": 126794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nazywamy to <strong>instrukcją else if</strong>. Ta instrukcja uruchamia swój blok kodu, jeśli warunek przed nią ma wartość <code>false</code>, a <code>hour &lt; 17</code> ma wartość <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hour</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "else statement",
            "id": 126795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy zaprogramować instrukcję <code>else</code>, aby wykonywała swój blok kodu, gdy warunki <code>if</code> i <code>else if</code> mają wartość <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"130\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 21\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>{</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
