\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to take this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>if</code>, a potem <code>age &lt; 17</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
